<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-News appoints new board member.</title>
<headline>RTRS-News appoints new board member.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>International media group News Corp Ltd said on Wednesday that Thomas J. Perkins has been elected to the company's board, expanding its number to 16.</p>
<p>News said Perkins, 64, was a founding partner at San Francisco-based venture capital company Kleiner Perkins Caulfield &amp; Byers. He is also chairman of Tandem Computers Inc and a director of Philips Electronics NV.</p>
<p>News chairman Rupert Murdoch said Perkins' expertise in computing and new technology would serve the company as it looked to expand its News Technology Group.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
